GSPBench includes processed subsets of NOAA Global Historical Climatology
Network - Daily (GHCN-Daily), Version 3 observations.

Dataset citation:
Menne, M. J. et al. (2012), Global Historical Climatology Network - Daily
(GHCN-Daily), Version 3, NOAA National Climatic Data Center,
doi:10.7289/V5D21VHZ.

